notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T10:48:39.250Z","harness:claude-code","Measured 2026-07-26 against the published 2026.7.26: post-publish verification covers execution only. verify-published-release.mjs runs npx --yes <pkg> --version, npx --yes --package <pkg> -- pm --version, and bunx --bun <pkg> pm --version. No install path is exercised for any manager — not npm install -g, not a project install, not bun add, not pnpm add — so packaging omissions and binary-link defects reach users through a green pipeline. Confirmed working by hand and therefore available as a starting fixture: bun add @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.7.26 links pm, pm-cli, and pm-mcp, and pm init, pm create, and pm list all succeed under the Bun runtime. The third check's invocation shape is separately defective and is owned by pm-lpqln4."
body: ""
